### BOOKS
GET http://localhost:5172/books

### Create Book
POST http://localhost:5172/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dune",
  "author": "Frank Herbert",
  "year": 1965
}

### Create Book (...BadRequest((YearIsOutOfRange)))
POST http://localhost:5172/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Time Traveler's Book",
  "author": "Someone",
  "year": -9
}
POST http://localhost:5172/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Future Book",
  "author": "Someone",
  "year": 9
}

### Delete Book
DELETE http://localhost:5172/books/3
DELETE http://localhost:5172/books/9999


### Update Book
PUT http://localhost:5172/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "YAA",
  "author": "David Bowie",
  "year": 1972
}

PUT http://localhost:5172/books/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unknown Book",
  "author": "Unknown Author",
  "year": 2000
}

### Get Book by Id
GET http://localhost:5172/books/1
GET http://localhost:5172/books/9999


### Get Books Page 1
GET http://localhost:5172/books?page=1&pageSize=2

### Get Books Page 2
GET http://localhost:5172/books?page=2&pageSize=10

### Search Books
GET http://localhost:5172/books?search=YAA

### Search Books With Paging
GET http://localhost:5172/books?search=dune&page=1&pageSize=5


### MEMBERS
### Get Members
GET http://localhost:5172/members

###

POST http://localhost:5172/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ada Lovelace",
    "email": "ada@example.com"
}

###

GET http://localhost:5172/members/1

###

PUT http://localhost:5172/members/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ada Byron",
    "email": "ada.byron@example.com"
}

###

DELETE http://localhost:5172/members/1


### SEARCH BUG - BOOKS
POST http://localhost:5172/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "50% Off Sale",
  "author": "Some Author",
  "year": 2020
}

POST http://localhost:5172/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "_Riyad Off Sale",
  "author": "Some Author",
  "year": 2020
}

### 2. Search for (% _)... should return ONLY the book above, not all books
### Search for the literal ((%)) character.
### '%' must be URL-encoded as '%25'. (For example, '%50' is decoded to 'P', not '%'.)
GET http://localhost:5172/books?search=%25&page=1&pageSize=5
GET http://localhost:5172/books?search=_&page=1&pageSize=5


### SEARCH BUG - MEMBERS

### 3. Add a member with a literal % in the name
POST http://localhost:5172/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "100% Riyad",
    "email": "riyad100@example.com"
}
POST http://localhost:5172/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "_ Riyad",
    "email": "riyad100@example.com"
}

### 4. Search for (% _)... should return ONLY the member above, not all members
GET http://localhost:5172/members?search=%25&page=1&pageSize=5
GET http://localhost:5172/members?search=_&page=1&pageSize=5
